::::segment{.folio}
# Scope of Work

The engagement covers a discovery audit of the existing document pipeline, a phased implementation of
the agreed changes, and a handover package. Each phase has a fixed fee, set out in the invoice that
follows this report.

## Discovery and audit

We review the current ingestion, conversion, and indexing paths, and produce a written assessment of
the gaps against the agreed acceptance criteria. The assessment is delivered before implementation
begins so that the plan can be adjusted while it is still cheap to do so.

## Implementation

Implementation proceeds in two-week increments against the assessment. Each increment ends with a
working build and a short note recording what changed and what remains.

## Documentation and handover

The final phase produces operator documentation and a recorded handover session, so the work can be
maintained without further engagement.
